    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton registry for the loaded patent model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds references to the prefab (Patent) and the currently instantiated scene object (ActivePatent), as well as the transform snapshot taken at spawn time for use by PatentTransformer.ResetRotation. </para>
